{"id":"u-7210f8b8-bac5-47c2-9851-48c4c670e98d","src":"community","title":"The Min-Max Program by JN","author":"Juwi","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/EiBCE3-the-min-max-program-by-jn","desc":"To maximize hypertrophy for lifters who only have about 45 minutes to train, 4 to 5\ntimes per week. That’s simply not enough time to do 3 to 4 sets of every exercise. Instead, you’ll do just 1 or 2\nhard sets of most exercises, usually taking them to failure.\n\n\nThis setup gives you the opportunity to focus more on quality over quantity. In my coaching experience, lowvolume, high-intensity training leads to better focus and execution on each individual set. When you know you\nonly have 1 or 2 sets to get the job done, there’s no room to coast. You have to make every set count.\n\n\nIt also helps reduce junk volume—excessive sets that have severely diminishing returns or sets that aren’t\nespecially challenging or stimulating. By keeping volume lower and effort higher, you maximize efficiency and\navoid wasting time or energy.","level":["Beginner","Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":50,"joins":37,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-09-25T21:43:50.312Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper","Lower","Upper 2","Lower 2","Arms & Delts"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"45° Incline Barbell Press","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":6,"rpeHi":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Pec Deck (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":6,"rpeHi":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Incline DB Y-Raise","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":6,"rpeHi":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Wide Grip Pull-Up","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Kelso Shrug","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":6,"rpeHi":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Preacher Curl (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":6,"rpeHi":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":6,"rpeHi":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lying Leg Raise","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":6,"rpeHi":8,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Leg Curl","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":6,"rpeHi